{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26232","headline":"潭州独步 · 殷尧藩","name":"潭州独步","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤发垂肩懒着巾，晚凉独步楚江滨。\n一帆暝色鸥边雨，数尺筇枝物外身。\n习巧未逢医拙手，闻歌先识采莲人。\n笑看斥鷃飞翔去，乐处蓬莱便有春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}